               --_u_s_e_r       Exclude   the   specified   _u_s_e_r   from   the   NIS
                           passwd/shadow map.

               --@@_n_e_t_g_r_o_u_p  Exclude all users in the given _n_e_t_g_r_o_u_p.

               ++           Include  every  user,  except  previously  excluded
                           ones, from the NIS passwd/shadow map.

           For ggrroouupp database:

               ++_g_r_o_u_p      Include the specified _g_r_o_u_p from the NIS group map.

               --_g_r_o_u_p      Exclude the specified _g_r_o_u_p from the NIS group map.

               ++           Include every  group,  except  previously  excluded
                           ones, from the NIS group map.

